🔄 How the Project Was Created

The project was developed through the following workflow:
Step 1 – Data Collection

Collected research study information from published reports and research sources.

Step 2 – Data Preparation

Structured the information into a consistent dataset containing study details, source, year, country/region, industry, research focus, key findings, and business impact.

Step 3 – Data Cleaning

Cleaned and formatted the dataset by checking categories, formatting fields, and ensuring consistency across the data.

Step 4 – PivotTable Analysis

Created multiple PivotTables to analyze:

* Industry distribution
* Country/Region distribution
* Business impact
* Research focus
* Year-wise research activity

Step 5 – Data Visualization

Converted the PivotTable analysis into charts to make the patterns easier to understand.

Step 6 – Dashboard Development

Combined the KPIs, charts, and interactive filters into a single Excel dashboard.

Step 7 – Insight Generation

Analyzed the dashboard results to identify important trends and business insights.

